# AccuWeather Pulse — Modern Weather Dashboard

- UI & Features: 
Shows current weather (hero card + 6 metrics like RealFeel, UV, humidity, wind, and rain chance), a 12-hour forecast strip, and a 5-day forecast list, plus 5 one-click city presets. You can switch °C / °F instantly without using API quota and toggle Day / Night themes automatically or manually.

- How It Works: 
Starts in Mock JSON mode (using local files in mock_data/ with city presets), so it runs out of the box without an API key. Entering a real AccuWeather API key and disabling Mock JSON fetches live data in a background thread to keep the UI responsive, with a dismissible banner for errors or quota limits.

To ues, install Python , then run https://academicpages.github.io/files/accuweather_gui.py (see the [ดูไฟล์ accuweather_gui.py](https://github.com/aleena-cha/aleena-cha.github.io/blob/master/files/accuweather_gui.py) README).
